{"synopsis":"Cheon Taesan, Ahli Reformasi Penjahat. Ia terkenal karena merehabilitasi penjahat-penjahat paling terkenal di Dunia Bela Diri (Murim). Lahir dengan Tubuh Bela Diri Langit, ia menghadapi nasib tragis di mana ia harus memperoleh Qi Primordial Tujuh Bintang hanya untuk memperpanjang umurnya. Saat berinteraksi dengan Tubuh Bintang Es yang misterius, ia semakin mendekati kebenaran tersembunyi di Dunia Bela Diri.","alternative_title":"절대학사","author":"Dunju","artist":"Aries","chapters":[{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"dcb2906d-192d-4db1-8830-a0b6f0dcee5a","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-03-24"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"a746c825-094d-4685-904a-fa4e56a1b40f","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-03-16"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"851049cc-8479-4dfc-98b7-2353d6886fb6","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-03-16"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"f3e88d34-c5c6-4d0b-8a76-01d7ffe63613","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-03-15"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"fd1fd79b-59e1-4b47-ba7f-584ce2d91ed6","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-02-26"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"2f4d613f-afb9-49b2-9540-2a30137780bd","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-02-19"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"355b74c7-66fc-4d08-974a-7aa6fdff9c46","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-02-16"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"16f47f38-a1c2-42aa-8e51-aefeb85c51b7","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-02-15"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"70cc5028-51ae-4f43-bf5d-bd42ba27ba07","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-02-15"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"e07cb962-1aaf-43d9-a227-1b3c1e99424f","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-02-15"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"d11e388a-0e5b-40d0-b78c-2bce9b339f60","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-02-15"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"6ec13d8d-59cc-461e-bad6-f18570e9a656","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-02-15"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"b31d2476-7d80-429e-a511-c8e8bb3b73bb","title":"C